# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Claude Code — local, per-machine settings, permission grants, session data and memory
# never leave this machine. Shared project instructions stay trackable: CLAUDE.md (repo root)
# and reviewed .claude/commands/, .claude/agents/ and .claude/skills/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
/.claude/*
!/.claude/commands/
!/.claude/agents/
!/.claude/skills/
.claude/**/settings.json
.claude/**/settings.local.json
**/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md
